    "description": "A clean from-scratch reimplementation of Mouse Tweaks for 1.4.7. Hold left-click (empty hand + sneak) to sweep stacks out of a slot, hold left-click on a held stack to merge matching stacks, and hold right-click to distribute one item per slot. Adds a small built-in pacing throttle on its own automated clicks so 1.4.7's one-at-a-time window-click transactions confirm before the next is sent - this stops the visual inventory desync (crafted items not showing until you click) that the old build caused, made worse by TickThreading. Client-side only; reads the GUI's own hovered slot so it works across modded inventories. Configurable per tweak.",
